  "body": "Hotfix for the current stable branch. Logs showed bot 6 repeatedly re-entering interactive login because its Vinted CAPTCHA/challenge was not positively recognized, so the job exited before `context.saveSession()` and no `bot-6.json` was installed.\n\nScope is intentionally narrow:\n- expand visible human-verification iframe detection to DataDome/captcha-delivery, Arkose/FunCaptcha, Geetest and generic visible captcha/challenge/human iframe markers;\n- add a few strong verification texts;\n- keep the existing 180s manual-verification wait;\n- keep fail-closed behavior: session is still saved only after LoginService subsequently verifies an authenticated Vinted state.\n\nNo scheduler, catalog, negotiation, pricing, quota, session storage format, or frontend changes.",
  "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:05:33Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-09-17T21:07:06Z",
